{"ID":"20240515131423-i5aq803","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131423-i5aq803","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131423-i5aq803\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134916-kh27d1z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134916-kh27d1z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134916-kh27d1z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:252,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:252\u0026#125;","title":"046","type":"doc","updated":"20240515155746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515134916-kh27d1z","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 784px;","id":"20240515134916-kh27d1z","updated":"20240515155746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GT"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"80歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/5"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌。上次因雙腳背不適，已治好。今次是腳外踝一帶麻腫。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.胃口：好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.口渴：渴，喜室溫飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.小便：淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.睡眠：2am-7am。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.痰：多而黃濁。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.身體寒熱：深夜時覺熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大有力，一息六至。夏逢夏脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紅淡乾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢，白芍一兩，炙甘草五錢，葦莖四錢，丹皮三錢，桃仁三錢，冬瓜仁三錢，黃耆五錢，牛膝三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡肺癌必熱，因有如汽車之水箱壞了，喪失散熱功能。肺癌以稀白痰為危險，今吐黃濁痰，情況尚好。吐白痰時用大劑桔梗甘草湯，黃濁痰則用千金葦莖湯意，凡無表證之黃濁痰，均以葦莖去之。如肺痛兼下痢，用紫參湯，紫參入血分以攻堅。病婦人八十歲，仍得肺癌，可證停經後仍有奶水，必須注意。另老人脈洪大有力，本為反脈，但正值炎夏，無虞。腳外踝腫麻，施針處理。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：針下雙足丘墟、申脈、俠溪。"}]}]}]}]}